========================================================================================================================
2. LIVE RULES ADOPTED 2026-09-01 OR LATER: ON vs OFF on complete data (live design, all else as live, L1 off)
========================================================================================================================
Cells: CAGR / Sharpe (mean/sd, no rf, as the project) / max DD.  real = 2015-11-03..2026-11-16, proxy = 2001-01-03..2026-11-16.  "excl" = daily returns of 2026-10-26..2026-11-16 dropped from both arms (paths run in full, days then removed).
d = ON minus OFF (Sharpe; max DD in pp, positive = ON shallower).  stretch = compounded return of the arm over 2026-10-26..2026-11-16.  boot = P(ON Sharpe > OFF Sharpe) over 400 paired stationary-bootstrap resamples (block 20) [5%,95%] of dSharpe.

